{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CesYpSmKJmT9sfSNPKHwv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! All tests pass successfully. Let me verify the implementation one more time by checking the key changes:\n\n## Summary\n\nI have successfully implemented the shipment confirmation endpoint (`POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm`) for BE-003. Here's what was done:\n\n### Changes Made:\n\n**1. Added error code for invalid shipment status** (`ApiError.kt`):\n   - Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS` to the `ErrorCode` enum to handle rejection of cancelled shipments\n\n**2. Implemented confirm endpoint** (`ShipmentController.kt`):\n   - Added `@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")` method that:\n     - Returns **404** if shipment doesn't exist → `ResourceNotFoundException`\n     - Returns **409** if shipment is `CANCELLED` → `ConflictException`  \n     - Transitions **CREATED → CONFIRMED** and persists the change\n     - Returns the **unchanged shipment** if already `CONFIRMED` (idempotent for retries)\n\n### Verification:\n\n✅ **All acceptance criteria met:**\n1. Existing build passes\n2. All 13 existing tests pass (0 failures, 0 errors)\n3. Confirms created shipments and persists state change\n4. Error responses consistent with existing API conventions\n5. Retry behavior: already-confirmed returns success, cancelled returns 409, unknown returns 404\n6. Zero new Maven dependencies\n7. Only modified shipment feature and API error files\n\nThe implementation is complete and ready for use."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":296,"cache_read_input_tokens":46342,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":296},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_i